As of [[Beta 0.2.2.5]], the Basic Pistol is the main weapon used in PvP combat. It uses [[Pistol Bullets|metal bullets]] as ammunition and does 23 damage with each shot. NOTE: Damage from bullets does not change, regardless of what material for them you use. (Same for Pistol itself)
